@model IEnumerable<BankApp_Models.KlantBericht>
@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc.Localization
@using Microsoft.Extensions.Localization
@using BankApp_Web.Translations
@inject IStringLocalizer<SharedResource> _localizer

@{
    ViewData["Title"] = @_localizer["Klantenberichten"];
}

<h1>@_localizer["Klantenberichten"]</h1>

@if (TempData["Success"] != null)
{
    <div class="alert alert-success">@TempData["Success"]</div>
}

@if (TempData["Error"] != null)
{
    <div class="alert alert-danger">@TempData["Error"]</div>
}

<div class="mb-3">
    <a asp-action="Index" class="btn btn-secondary">@_localizer["Terug naar Wachtende Transacties"]</a>
</div>

<table class="table table-striped">
    <thead>
        <tr>
            <th>@_localizer["Datum"]</th>
            <th>@_localizer["Naam"]</th>
            <th>@_localizer["Email"]</th>
            <th>@_localizer["Onderwerp"]</th>
            <th>@_localizer["Status"]</th>
            <th>@_localizer["Acties"]</th>
        </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
        @foreach (var item in Model)
        {
            <tr>
                <td>@Html.DisplayFor(modelItem => item.Datum)</td>
                <td>@Html.DisplayFor(modelItem => item.Naam)</td>
                <td>@Html.DisplayFor(modelItem => item.Email)</td>
                <td>@Html.DisplayFor(modelItem => item.Onderwerp)</td>
                <td>
                    @if (item.Status == "Nieuw")
                    {
                        <span class="badge bg-warning">@_localizer["Nieuw"]</span>
                    }
                    else if (item.Status == "InBehandeling")
                    {
                        <span class="badge bg-info">@_localizer["In Behandeling"]</span>
                    }
                    else
                    {
                        <span class="badge bg-success">@_localizer["Afgehandeld"]</span>
                    }
                </td>
                <td>
                    <a asp-action="BerichtDetails" asp-route-id="@item.Id" class="btn btn-sm btn-info">@_localizer["Details"]</a>
                </td>
            </tr>
        }
    </tbody>
</table>

@if (!Model.Any())
{
    <p class="text-muted">@_localizer["Geen klantenberichten"]</p>
}
